# eCash (Bitcoin ABC) v0.24.11 — base for v1 (Lotus mainnet) patch series
# Source: git@github.com:Bitcoin-ABC/bitcoin-abc.git
#
# This is a static pin — lotusd forked from eCash v0.24.11 and the v1 patch
# series applies cleanly to this exact commit.  There is no plan to rebase v1
# onto a newer eCash / bitcoin-abc commit; the v1 series is archive / reference.
#
# The 42 patches in patches/v1/ bring this base up to lotusd v10.4.10 (Lotus
# mainnet, 2nd Samuel + Taproot active).
#
# To add a newer lotusd version as a patch:
#   1. In workspace-v1 (must already have all 42 patches applied):
#      git remote add lotusd https://github.com/LotusiaStewardship/lotusd.git
#      git fetch lotusd --tags
#      git diff HEAD lotusd/v10.4.11 > /tmp/v1-upgrade.diff
#   2. Apply, commit, and export:
#      git apply --whitespace=nowarn /tmp/v1-upgrade.diff
#      git add -A && git commit -m "lotusd v10.4.11"
#      make mkpatch SERIES=v1 NAME=43-version-10.4.11
#   3. Update lotusd-version to v10.4.11
